==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[incumbrance]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something that [[encumber]]s; a [[burden]] that must be [[carried]].
# {{context|legal}} an [[interest]], [[right]], [[burden]], or [[liability]] attached to a [[title]] of [[land]], such as a [[lien]] or [[mortgage]].

